From: Erik Schnetter <eschnetter@perimeterinstitute.ca>
Date: 2012-05-05
Subject: Ensure that the scratch directory does not yet exist

Ensure that the scratch directory does not exist when a restart is
created.

Clean up the code handling scratch directories.


Index: simfactory/lib/simrestart.py
===================================================================
--- simfactory/lib/simrestart.py	(revision 1655)
+++ simfactory/lib/simrestart.py	(working copy)
